#### Spesifikasi Teknologi:
- **Core 3D Engine:** Three.js (`v0.166.x`)
- **Bundler & Build Tool:** Vite (`v5.3.x`)
- **Animasi & Lerping:** GSAP (`v3.12.x`)
- **Model 3D Asset:** GLB dengan kompresi Draco (`final7.glb`, terkompresi ~2.55 MB)
- **Audio Engine:** Native Web Audio API (`AudioListener`, `AudioBufferSourceNode`)
- **Post-Processing:** `EffectComposer`, `RenderPass`, `UnrealBloomPass`, `OutputPass`

